These body lines are NOT in YAML frontmatter. Intended path LICENSE.md is
config-class (LICENSE.* arm) so it routes to cfg = whole-file scan, which still
catches these. If a future edit routed LICENSE.md to md mode, this fixture goes
RED (md would slice only frontmatter, find none, emit nothing, ALLOW).
